  "body": "Elevate your lifestyle in this whole-floor waterfront retreat, newly transformed to the highest standard. Soaring above the shoreline, the home offers absolute privacy, an immersive feeling of floating over the water and unobstructed views across to Rangitoto.\r\n\r\nModern elegance defines every detail-from the stunning dream kitchen to the beautifully appointed three bedrooms (master with an ensuite)  and two brand new fully tiled bathrooms. Paired with private lift access directly into the apartment, a true double garage which is off the road (not underground), extra storage, and immediate proximity to vibrant seaside dining, this is low-maintenance luxury at its finest. Those wanting sunshine, security and a sophisticated Auckland bolt hole with views looking east and west along the coastline, call us now for a private inspection. \r\n\r\n* Unit Title\r\n\r\n* Floor Area: 126 sqm (approx.)\r\n\r\n* Council Rates: $7,688.78 p/a (2025/26)\r\n\r\n* CV: $2,575,000 (2024)\r\n\r\n* School Zones: Kohimarama School, Selwyn College, Baradene College\r\n\r\n* Rental Appraisal: $2,000 - $ 2,500 per week\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease call JAYNE KIELY 021 352 007 or AMY ROBERTSON 0274 820 100\r\n\r\nWe work with all agencies. Conjunctions are welcome.",
